{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55385","headline":"颂 诸佛不出世，四十九年说。祖师不西来，少林有妙诀。 · 绍修","name":"颂 诸佛不出世，四十九年说。祖师不西来，少林有妙诀。","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万法是心光，诸缘唯性晓。\n本无迷悟人，秪要今日了。\n（见《五灯会元》卷八。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"绍修","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55385.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55385","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}